#. Tag: para
#: htmltools.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This plugin will open a dialog which will prompt your for a &HTML; tag name. "
"Attributes and values to be put in the opening tag should be entered "
"<userinput><replaceable>attribute-name</replaceable>="
"\"<replaceable>attribute-value</replaceable>\"</userinput>. After pressing "
"&Enter;, the opening -- and respective closing -- tag will be placed into "
"the document."
msgstr ""

